---
/**
 * Banner de promoción semanal (2x1 en delivery).
 */
---

<section id="promociones" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface py-14">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-primary-container/40 bg-gradient-to-r from-surface-container-lowest via-surface-container-high to-surface-container-lowest p-8 shadow-2xl md:p-12">
      <!-- Acento de luz de fondo -->
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-primary-container/20 blur-3xl"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-8 text-center lg:flex-row lg:text-left">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary-container px-3 py-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-on-primary-container">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" aria-hidden="true">local_fire_department</span>
            Promoción Exclusiva Semanal
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile leading-tight text-on-surface md:text-headline-lg">
            ¡Martes &amp; Jueves de Rolls 2x1 en Delivery!
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface/80">
            Aplica en todos nuestros rolls tradicionales y de autor al pedir por nuestro canal directo. Utiliza el código al
            confirmar tu orden.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-primary-container bg-surface-container-lowest px-4 py-2">
            <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface/70">Código cupón:</span>
            <span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-extrabold tracking-widest text-primary">SUSHIFANS24</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-secondary px-8 py-4 font-label-md text-label-md font-bold tracking-wider text-on-secondary shadow-lg transition-all hover:opacity-90 active:scale-95"
            href="https://wa.me/?text=Quiero%20usar%20el%20codigo%20SUSHIFANS24"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat</span>
            Pedir por WhatsApp 2x1
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
